[00:12.44]1. Jehovah, God of love,
[00:12.48]You have promised us your peace.
[00:20.32]So we ask you for your spirit;
[00:20.32]May its fruitage yet increase.
[00:26.32]Our faith in your dear Son,
[00:56.80]Who is loyal, ever true,
[01:01.14]Gives us access to your friendship;
[01:05.24]We are now at peace with you.
[01:14.69]2. Your spirit aids our sight
[01:18.95]As your Word gives needed light.
[01:23.27]We are guided and protected
[01:27.29]In a world as dark as night.
[01:31.83]Until the time has come
[01:36.05]When all wars and terrors cease,
[01:40.39]May your spirit bless our efforts
[01:45.39]To maintain our godly peace.
[02:05.15]3. You’ve gathered those you love,
[02:09.37]Both in heaven and on earth,
[02:13.51]We’re united by your spirit
[02:17.75]To proclaim the Kingdom’s birth.
[02:24.43]Your righteous Kingdom rule
[02:28.71]Soon will bring an end to war.
[02:33.73]Then the meek ones will delight to
[02:37.69]Live in peace forevermore.
